  "title": "Easy Ground Turkey Stew",
  "description": "This ground turkey stew is simmered in a slow cooker with tomato soup, onion, potatoes, carrots, and Worcestershire for a comforting, no-fuss meal.",
  "authors": [
    "IndyBlakester"
  ],
